{
  "source": "Prompts/build-your-skills-opener-9.mp4",
  "duration": 176.8199375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.58,
      "text": "AI platforms update constantly, adding features and shifting interfaces, but the mental habits"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.58,
      "end": 8.54,
      "text": "you develop while using them stick around."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.5,
      "end": 11.88,
      "text": "Think back to when you first learned to ride a bike."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.4,
      "end": 17.06,
      "text": "Eventually, you outgrew that frame and moved on to something else, but you didn't leave"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.06,
      "end": 17.56,
      "text": "empty-handed."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.06,
      "end": 22.12,
      "text": "You walked away with a deeply ingrained physical sense of balance."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.9,
      "end": 26.54,
      "text": "That internal equilibrium carried over into entirely different arenas."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.54,
      "end": 30.7,
      "text": "It made you steadier on ice skates and quicker on a basketball court."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.5,
      "end": 36.66,
      "text": "Whether you went on to race competitively or only ride on lazy Sunday afternoons, that"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.66,
      "end": 39.58,
      "text": "baseline physical literacy belonged to you permanently."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.6,
      "end": 43.28,
      "text": "And nobody could simply hand that ability over to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.6,
      "end": 46.02,
      "text": "You had to earn it through your own repetitions."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.16,
      "end": 49.26,
      "text": "The same rule applies to cognitive work."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.9,
      "end": 52.3,
      "text": "The app in front of you is a temporary training environment."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.1,
      "end": 57.9,
      "text": "Your own mental agility is the permanent asset that actually allows you to navigate a"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.9,
      "end": 58.7,
      "text": "shifting landscape."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.44,
      "end": 62.7,
      "text": "Instead of physical balance, you're now strengthening mental muscles."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.46,
      "end": 67.54,
      "text": "Thinking carefully, working smoothly with others, and staying actively curious."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.66,
      "end": 71.18,
      "text": "You happen to be using AI to practice right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.74,
      "end": 77.46,
      "text": "However, these exact capabilities dictate your success in a classroom, a boardroom, and"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.46,
      "end": 78.18,
      "text": "everyday life."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.18,
      "end": 84.78,
      "text": "When everybody in your field can access the exact same generative engine, your distinct"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.78,
      "end": 88.1,
      "text": "choices and personal judgment determine the final outcome."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.98,
      "end": 94.2,
      "text": "This roadmap, titled Build Your Skills, outlines exactly how we will approach this practice."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.04,
      "end": 97.44,
      "text": "Pillar 1 covers judgment and responsibility."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.44,
      "end": 104.02,
      "text": "We will practice questioning claims, weighing evidence, protecting your data, and using these"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.02,
      "end": 104.82,
      "text": "systems honestly."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.76,
      "end": 108.98,
      "text": "Pillar 2 focuses on people skills and creative thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.76,
      "end": 114.88,
      "text": "No work on how to communicate your ideas, collaborate effectively, and iterate to find"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.88,
      "end": 115.66,
      "text": "better approaches."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.64,
      "end": 119.2,
      "text": "Finally, Pillar 3 zeroes in on curiosity."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.28,
      "end": 126.24,
      "text": "We will follow trailing questions, explore your specific interests, and determine clear, actionable"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.24,
      "end": 127.22,
      "text": "next steps you can take."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.76,
      "end": 131.52,
      "text": "Notice that none of these steps require you to memorize a specific interface."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.52,
      "end": 136.72,
      "text": "We are building the human capacities that remain useful long after the current software"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.72,
      "end": 137.48,
      "text": "cycle ends."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.44,
      "end": 140.62,
      "text": "This curriculum is an upgrade for the human operator."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.44,
      "end": 145.76,
      "text": "As we move through the rest of this course, keep one specific question in the back of your"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.76,
      "end": 145.98,
      "text": "mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.56,
      "end": 151.6,
      "text": "If everyone sitting next to you has the exact same tool, what do you bring to the table that"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.6,
      "end": 152.04,
      "text": "it doesn't?"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.64,
      "end": 157.2,
      "text": "This upcoming section is designed to help you construct a definitive, personal answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.2,
      "end": 157.76,
      "text": "to that dilemma."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.68,
      "end": 163.52,
      "text": "As this image makes clear, the tools themselves will inevitably change, but the skills you"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.52,
      "end": 165.18,
      "text": "extract from them are yours to keep."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.94,
      "end": 171.34,
      "text": "Your objective here is to master your own thinking, ensuring you are always ready to"
    },
    {
      "start": 171.34,
      "end": 173.3,
      "text": "direct whatever technology comes next."
    }
  ],
